    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for distribution utility systems based on IEC 61968 Common Information Model (CIM) standards. Provides access to network assets, outage management, customer information, meter reading, and work management data using CIM-compliant resource representations. Implements IEC 61968 Parts 3, 4, 9, and 11 interfaces for distribution management systems (DMS) integration.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: CIM User Group",
